WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:08.372
Administrators see every sold site under Subscriptions, Site provisioning:

00:00:08.372 --> 00:00:13.620
the site name, its status, the owner, when it was bought, and the attempts.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.989
The site checks for waiting jobs every minute.

00:00:16.989 --> 00:00:20.617
Waiting means it is paid for and waiting its turn.

00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:24.698
Created means the site exists, and the buyer can sign in.

00:00:24.698 --> 00:00:28.650
To try a waiting job now, click Retry now, and confirm.

00:00:30.246 --> 00:00:32.781
Back on My Sites, the site is Ready.

00:00:32.781 --> 00:00:38.576
Open takes the buyer to it, to sign in with the administrator account entered at checkout.

